{"step_index":334,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:52:02Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-14T12:52:02+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-14T12:52:06+09:00\nThe search for \"site:1daysample.com OR \"디쓰리디\" \"하지태\" \"전화\" OR \"TEL\" OR \"051\" OR \"02\" OR \"010\"\" returned the following summary:\n검색 결과에 따른 `1daysample.com` (주식회사 디쓰리디) 관련 기업 정보는 다음과 같습니다[1]:\n\n* **상호명:** (주)디쓰리디 (1DAY SAMPLE)[1]\n* **대표자:** 하지태[1]\n* **주소:** 서울특별시 종로구 종로39길 22, 나동 5층(종로6가)[1]\n* **전화번호:** 02-912-0506[1]\n* **팩스번호:** 02-763-0505[1]\n* **사업자등록번호:** 236-81-00379[1]\n* **통신판매업신고번호:** 2021-서울중구-2447[1]\n\nSources:\n[1] [1daysample.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFpDs4bRlZUcAObCVvMuRlSzEzAmENSP8968IQtTFeRyBxqn2ueuLGNrLHWywrlZW8IgS2r9D9NhRUuPqzXlBKCsxActJp7hJ9W6-y5WSp0GEPoM80sciWgOrxmIIjTCoY=)"}
